Where is the main water shut-off valve?	sample data
In most houses it sits where the water line comes into the house.	sample data
Where to look, in this order	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
1 In the garage, or a closet on the street side In many homes in central Texas the line comes in through a slab	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
3 On an outside wall, near a hose bib	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
4 In the curb box in front of the house If you can’t find it indoors	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
How do you turn off a lever valve and a wheel valve?	sample data
Turn a lever (ball) valve a quarter turn until the handle sits across the pipe. Turn a wheel (gate) valve clockwise until it stops; it can take several turns, and it should not be forced.	sample data
1 Close the main valve.	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
2 Open the lowest faucet in the house, and an outside tap, to drain the pipes.	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
3 Turn off the water heater: switch off its breaker, or set the gas control to “pilot”.	owner 2026-10-20 Q7: inline step and list visuals (E9) wait on #1743
What if the valve is stuck or you can’t find it?	sample data
Don’t force it with a wrench. An old gate valve can break off in the pipe. The meter-side valve in the curb box may need a meter key, and some utilities ask homeowners to call them instead. The emergency number is on your water bill (	sample data
). Sample source	sample data: the board's own Sample tag
Can you turn off water to just one fixture?	sample data
Yes. Most toilets and sinks have a small stop valve under them, which closes clockwise or with a quarter turn. That is enough for a running toilet or a leaking tap, but not for a burst pipe in a wall.	sample data
What should you do once the water is off?	sample data
Mop up standing water and move valuables. Take photos for your insurer before you clean up. Leave the valve closed until the leak is repaired.	sample data
When should you call an emergency plumber?	sample data
Call one straight away in any of these cases.	sample data
